# Project Conventions

## Commit Messages
Use conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, `docs:`

## Secrets
- No secrets in version control
- `NEWSFEED_SERVICE_TOKEN` stored in SSM Parameter Store, read at boot via IAM
- `terraform.tfvars` is gitignored -- use `terraform.tfvars.example` as the template
- Never put credentials in `.tf` files or commit output containing secrets

## Shell Scripts
- Always start with `#!/bin/bash` and `set -euxo pipefail`
- Use `dnf` (not `yum`) on AL2023

## Architecture Scope
- Region: af-south-1 (Cape Town), single environment (dev)
- Public subnets only, no HA -- this is a time-boxed demo
- HTTP only (no TLS) -- sufficient for dev/test verification

## Decision Making
- When in doubt, choose simplicity over perfection
- Document trade-offs in `docs/trade-offs.md`
- Always tag resources via provider `default_tags`

